1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:10,000
What happens when the same monkeys live under different rules?

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Monkey Republic is not just a game about bananas.

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Every monkey has two choices: share, or grab.

4
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:48,000
If sharing creates value, trust has room to grow.

5
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:04,000
The first few rounds are slow, so students can see cause and effect.

6
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Then the computer runs the society faster and faster.

7
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:33,000
The takeaway is not a simple sentence. It is a question.

8
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:46,000
How do we think, create, search for significance, and contribute to real-world problems that matter?

9
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Monkey Republic. A Lucas Academy social experiment.
